      "value": "<p><strong>Save Attack.</strong> One target within 6 squares rolls <strong>Resolve</strong> vs DC 15. Hit: <code>4d8</code> qliphothic + soul. On a failed save the wraith then teleports to an unoccupied space within 1 square of the target. On a success, half damage and no teleport.</p><p><em>It flickers to where you'll be standing, and drinks the difference.</em></p>",
